/** @page msgpackreleasenotesguide Release Notes

    @tableofcontents

    @section msgpackv1_0_2 MessagePack Module Version 1.0.2
    - a map key with a NUL character raises \c UNPACK-ERROR when unpacking; previously the key was cut at the NUL
      character, so it named another key
    - in @ref msgpack_qore_mode "Qore mode", a map key in a character encoding other than the default encoding names
      the same key as the equivalent string in the default encoding; previously its bytes were used as they were
    - an encoding conversion error when packing or unpacking raises only \c ENCODING-CONVERSION-ERROR; previously a
      second \c PACK-ERROR or \c UNPACK-ERROR exception was raised with it
    - packing a deleted @ref msgpack::MsgPackExtension "MsgPackExtension" object in a list or hash raises only
      \c OBJECT-ALREADY-DELETED; previously debug builds aborted, and other builds raised a second \c PACK-ERROR
      exception with it
    - fixed a memory leak when packing a value that cannot be serialized

    @section msgpackv1_0_1 MessagePack Module Version 1.0.1
    - aligned with %Qore changes related to doxygen

    @section msgpackv1_0 MessagePack Module Version 1.0
    - initial release
*/
